msgctxt "92"
msgid "(A girl in a baseball cap... Is this the right Sakura?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, there. Is your name Sakura?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Nuh-uh. I'm Kanae. Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I'm just looking for a lost girl. Where'd you get the cap?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"This? There was this girl from Tokyo who said she wanted my ribbon, so she "
"traded me for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "(A ribbon. Great.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"I like sports! I don't wanna be a girly-girl... But my mom just won't "
"listen! She keeps dressing me up in cute stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Okay, well... thanks anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"(Now I'm looking for a girl in a ribbon? Why does this have to be so "
"complicated?)"
msgstr ""

